          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { m A } = 1 0 ^ { - 3 }   \\mathrm { A } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " or in microampere (1 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mu \\mathrm{A} = 10^{-6}   \\mathrm{A}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "An instrument called ammeter measures electric current in a circuit. It is always connected in series in a circuit through which the current is to be measured. Figure 11.1 shows the schematic diagram of a typical electric circuit comprising a cell, an electric bulb, an ammeter and a plug key. Note that the electric current flows in the circuit from the positive terminal of the cell to the negative terminal of the cell through the bulb and ammeter.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.555,
            0.453,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 11.1"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.305,
            0.571,
            0.9,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A current of 0.5 A is drawn by a filament of an electric bulb for 10 minutes. Find the amount of electric charge that flows through the circuit.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.627,
            0.398,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.644,
            0.669,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We are given, I = 0.5 A; t = 10 min = 600 s.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
